Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): preserve weighted classes under unrelated
 provider walls [daveey]

Root: class-wall evidence included providers absent from eligible candidates, so any host wall forced routes[0] before weighted allocation. Scope persisted and extra wall evidence to candidate providers; keep live per-model walls and all-walled admission unchanged.

Proof: real dispatch regression and no-wall control 1 pass/1 fail before; four new cases 1 pass/3 fail before, green after. Focused six files 77/0; importing/facade sweep 87 files 1785/2 exposed two stale concrete-route expectations in Anthropic-only fixtures. Corrected whole-file plus matching/unrelated wall controls pass; no quota or review custody relaxation. Full scripts/check passed. Fleet remediation/deployment remains separately open.
